@startuml
state ViewTime as "View and Adjust Time"
state ChangeHour as "Changing Hour"
state ChangeMinutes as "Changing Minutes"
state AlarmOnOff as "Alarm On/Off"
state AlarmRing as "Alarm Ring"
state AlarmStop as "Alarm Stop"
state LightOnOff as "Light On/Off"

ViewTime --> ChangeHour : hour button press
ViewTime --> ChangeMinutes : minutes button press
ViewTime --> AlarmOnOff : alarm button press
ChangeHour --> [*] : increase value
ChangeMinutes --> [*] : increase value
AlarmOnOff --> [*] : toggle alarm
AlarmRing --> AlarmStop : current time matches set alarm time
LightOnOff --> LightOn : button press
LightOnOff --> LightOff : button release
@enduml
